{"seq":4,"slug":"hooks-with-tier-1-bridge","title":"与 Tier 1 Hooks 协同的跨 tier 桥接模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/hooks-with-tier-1-bridge","wordCount":1253,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"与-tier-1-hooks-协同的跨-tier-桥接模式\">与 Tier 1 Hooks 协同的跨 tier 桥接模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes transform pipeline 与 OpenClaw outbound webhook 是 Tier 2 personal-agent 工具栈的事件机制；Claude Code 的 Hook（SessionStart / PreToolUse / Stop 等）是 Tier 1 工具栈的事件机制。两者各自独立运行，但通过 stdin/stdout JSON-RPC 与 HTTP webhook 这两条标准通道可以互相调用，形成跨 tier 编排。本篇讲两条核心桥接模式：<strong>(A) Hermes Plugin 内 spawn Claude Code subprocess 把 hook stdout 当 transform 输入</strong>——让 Tier 2 借用 Tier 1 的 Claude 推理能力；<strong>(B) OpenClaw webhook 作 Claude Code Stop hook 的 SOP enforcement 后端</strong>——让 Tier 2 的合规决策能反向 block Tier 1 agent stop。两条模式覆盖了 95% 跨 tier 协同需求，剩余的 5% 走通用 <a href=\"../../../bridges/\"><code>../../../03_bridges/</code></a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  T1[Tier 1: Claude Code] -. stdin/stdout .-&gt; T2[Tier 2: Hermes/OpenClaw]&#10;  T2 -. webhook + signature .-&gt; T1\">flowchart LR\n  T1[Tier 1: Claude Code] -. stdin/stdout .-&gt; T2[Tier 2: Hermes/OpenClaw]\n  T2 -. webhook + signature .-&gt; T1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A: Plugin spawn CC</td>\n<td>T2 → T1</td>\n<td>stdin/stdout JSON-RPC</td>\n<td>curator 用 CC 评估 trajectory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B: Webhook 作 Stop hook</td>\n<td>T2 → T1（反向阻断）</td>\n<td>HTTP webhook + signature</td>\n<td>SOP enforcement</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式-a-hermes-plugin-spawn-claude-code\">模式 A：Hermes Plugin spawn Claude Code</h2><p>Hermes Plugin 在业务处理过程中可能需要&quot;问一下 Claude 该怎么办&quot;——例如 curator 看见某 skill 上次失败的 trajectory，想让 Claude 反思失败原因。Plugin 不直接调 Anthropic API（避免 secret 在 plugin 层暴露），而是 spawn 一个 Claude Code subprocess，把问题塞 stdin，等待 stdout 返回：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant P as Hermes Plugin&#10;  participant CC as Claude Code subprocess&#10;  participant H as Claude Code Hook&#10;  P-&gt;&gt;CC: spawn with stdin payload&#10;  CC-&gt;&gt;H: SessionStart hook&#10;  H--&gt;&gt;CC: hook stdout (context)&#10;  CC-&gt;&gt;CC: process query&#10;  CC--&gt;&gt;P: stdout response&#10;  P-&gt;&gt;P: parse + transform\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant P as Hermes Plugin\n  participant CC as Claude Code subprocess\n  participant H as Claude Code Hook\n  P-&gt;&gt;CC: spawn with stdin payload\n  CC-&gt;&gt;H: SessionStart hook\n  H--&gt;&gt;CC: hook stdout (context)\n  CC-&gt;&gt;CC: process query\n  CC--&gt;&gt;P: stdout response\n  P-&gt;&gt;P: parse + transform</pre><p>实现示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def curator_evaluate_trajectory(plugin_ctx, trajectory):&#10;    proc = subprocess.run(&#10;        [&quot;claude&quot;, &quot;-p&quot;, &quot;--output-format&quot;, &quot;json&quot;],&#10;        input=json.dumps({&quot;trajectory&quot;: trajectory}),&#10;        capture_output=True,&#10;        timeout=60,&#10;    )&#10;    assessment = json.loads(proc.stdout)&#10;    plugin_ctx.emit(InternalEvent(&#10;        event_type=&quot;trajectory_assessed&quot;,&#10;        payload=assessment,&#10;    ))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curator_evaluate_trajectory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(plugin_ctx, trajectory):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    proc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subprocess.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-p\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"--output-format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">json.dumps({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trajectory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: trajectory}),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        capture_output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assessment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.loads(proc.stdout)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugin_ctx.emit(InternalEvent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trajectory_assessed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">assessment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ))</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>timeout</td>\n<td>60s</td>\n<td>超过 Tier 1 hook 默认上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>max output</td>\n<td>1MB</td>\n<td>防 Claude 失控刷屏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nested call depth</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>spawn 出的 CC 不能再 spawn Hermes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>working dir</td>\n<td>tmp dir</td>\n<td>防 spawn 的 CC 读到 plugin 文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>depth=0 限制就是为了避免 <a href=\"../mcp-bidirectional/anti-recursion-and-orchestration\"><code>../3_mcp-bidirectional/4_anti-recursion-and-orchestration.md</code></a> 里描述的循环——subprocess 内若再回调 Hermes 会形成 trace_id 重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hook-stdout-作-transform-输入\">hook stdout 作 transform 输入</h2><p>更精巧的用法是：spawn 的 Claude Code 配置自定义 hook，hook 的 stdout 不是给 CC agent 看的 context，而是直接给 plugin 当 transform 输入。这样 plugin 等于借用了 Tier 1 hook 的可插拔机制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  P[Plugin emit subprocess] --&gt; CC[Claude Code spawn]&#10;  CC --&gt; SS[SessionStart hook]&#10;  SS --&gt; SH[Custom shell hook]&#10;  SH --&gt; OUT[hook stdout]&#10;  OUT --&gt; P2[Plugin parse hook stdout]&#10;  P2 --&gt; T[transform_in chain]\">flowchart LR\n  P[Plugin emit subprocess] --&gt; CC[Claude Code spawn]\n  CC --&gt; SS[SessionStart hook]\n  SS --&gt; SH[Custom shell hook]\n  SH --&gt; OUT[hook stdout]\n  OUT --&gt; P2[Plugin parse hook stdout]\n  P2 --&gt; T[transform_in chain]</pre><p>举例：plugin 想从 spawn 出的 CC 那里得到&quot;当前项目的最新 git status&quot;。它把 SessionStart hook 配置成 <code>git status --porcelain</code>，hook stdout 直接被 plugin 接住作为 fact source，无需让 Claude agent 自己跑 bash。这种&quot;绕开 agent loop 借用 hook&quot;模式可以把跨 tier 调用延迟从分钟级压到秒级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式-b-openclaw-webhook-作-stop-hook-后端\">模式 B：OpenClaw webhook 作 Stop hook 后端</h2><p>第二条模式方向相反——Tier 1 Claude Code agent 想结束工作时（Stop hook 触发），需要 Tier 2 OpenClaw 判定&quot;SOP 还没走完，不允许 stop&quot;。这是合规与质量门禁的典型场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant CC as Claude Code agent&#10;  participant SH as Stop hook&#10;  participant OC as OpenClaw webhook&#10;  CC-&gt;&gt;SH: agent ready to stop&#10;  SH-&gt;&gt;OC: POST stop_check&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: check SOP completion&#10;  alt SOP done&#10;    OC--&gt;&gt;SH: 200 {allow: true}&#10;    SH--&gt;&gt;CC: exit 0 (allow stop)&#10;  else SOP incomplete&#10;    OC--&gt;&gt;SH: 200 {allow: false, reason: &quot;...&quot;, continue_prompt: &quot;...&quot;}&#10;    SH--&gt;&gt;CC: exit 2 + stderr (force continue)&#10;  end\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant CC as Claude Code agent\n  participant SH as Stop hook\n  participant OC as OpenClaw webhook\n  CC-&gt;&gt;SH: agent ready to stop\n  SH-&gt;&gt;OC: POST stop_check\n  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: check SOP completion\n  alt SOP done\n    OC--&gt;&gt;SH: 200 {allow: true}\n    SH--&gt;&gt;CC: exit 0 (allow stop)\n  else SOP incomplete\n    OC--&gt;&gt;SH: 200 {allow: false, reason: \"...\", continue_prompt: \"...\"}\n    SH--&gt;&gt;CC: exit 2 + stderr (force continue)\n  end</pre><p>Stop hook 是 Claude Code 标准 hook，返回 exit code 2 + stderr 强制 agent 继续工作而不能 stop。配合 OpenClaw 的 outbound webhook，&quot;agent 是否能停&quot;的决策被外置到 Tier 2：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env bash&#10;# .claude/hooks/stop-sop-check.sh&#10;payload=$(cat)&#10;resp=$(curl -sS -X POST https://openclaw.local/sop/check \\&#10;  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  -H &quot;X-Signature: $(sign &quot;$payload&quot;)&quot; \\&#10;  -d &quot;$payload&quot;)&#10;if echo &quot;$resp&quot; | jq -e &#39;.allow == true&#39; &gt; /dev/null; then&#10;  exit 0&#10;else&#10;  reason=$(echo &quot;$resp&quot; | jq -r &#39;.reason&#39;)&#10;  prompt=$(echo &quot;$resp&quot; | jq -r &#39;.continue_prompt&#39;)&#10;  echo &quot;SOP check failed: $reason&quot; &gt;&amp;2&#10;  echo &quot;$prompt&quot; &gt;&amp;2&#10;  exit 2&#10;fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .claude/hooks/stop-sop-check.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://openclaw.local/sop/check</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"X-Signature: $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$payload</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\")\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$payload</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$resp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.allow == true'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$resp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.reason'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$resp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.continue_prompt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"SOP check failed: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$reason</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >&#x26;2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$prompt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >&#x26;2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OpenClaw 的判定逻辑可能涉及&quot;该 persona 必须完成 audit-trail-write 才能 stop&quot;或&quot;还有未确认的 cross-tenant access 申请&quot;——这种业务规则不应放进 CC hook 脚本，而由 OpenClaw 集中维护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨-tier-协议层\">跨 tier 协议层</h2><p>两条模式共用一组协议约定，避免每个项目重复发明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据格式</td>\n<td>JSON-RPC 2.0（stdin/stdout）+ JSON over HTTP（webhook）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名</td>\n<td>HMAC SHA-256（webhook）+ secret env 注入（subprocess）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试</td>\n<td>指数退避，1/4/16/64s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时</td>\n<td>60s（subprocess）/ 5s（webhook 同步）/ 30s（webhook 长轮询）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追踪</td>\n<td>trace_id 必须透传到对端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>trace_id 透传特别关键——它让&quot;一次用户操作触发的所有跨 tier 调用&quot;能在 audit log 上聚合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  U[User msg] --&gt; CC1[Claude Code trace_id=abc]&#10;  CC1 -. subprocess .-&gt; P[Hermes Plugin trace_id=abc]&#10;  P -. webhook .-&gt; OC[OpenClaw trace_id=abc]&#10;  OC -. response .-&gt; P&#10;  P --&gt; CC1&#10;  CC1 --&gt; U\">flowchart LR\n  U[User msg] --&gt; CC1[Claude Code trace_id=abc]\n  CC1 -. subprocess .-&gt; P[Hermes Plugin trace_id=abc]\n  P -. webhook .-&gt; OC[OpenClaw trace_id=abc]\n  OC -. response .-&gt; P\n  P --&gt; CC1\n  CC1 --&gt; U</pre><p>debug 跨 tier 问题时只要 grep <code>trace_id=abc</code> 就能拼出整条链的时序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该选哪条模式\">何时该选哪条模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐模式</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Tier 2 需要 LLM 推理</td>\n<td>A (spawn CC)</td>\n<td>不要让 Tier 2 直连 Anthropic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 1 agent 行为受合规约束</td>\n<td>B (Stop hook webhook)</td>\n<td>决策外置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 2 需要 git/fs 操作</td>\n<td>A 的 hook stdout 变体</td>\n<td>借 hook 跳过 agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 1 想读 Tier 2 状态</td>\n<td>走 MCP server</td>\n<td>详见 <a href=\"../mcp-bidirectional/\"><code>../3_mcp-bidirectional/</code></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模式 A 适合&quot;Tier 2 主动&quot;的跨 tier 调用，模式 B 适合&quot;Tier 1 被动&quot;的反向约束。MCP server 走另一条 <a href=\"../mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-hermes\"><code>../3_mcp-bidirectional/1_server-side-impl-hermes.md</code></a> 描述的双向方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>subprocess spawn 不设 timeout</strong>：CC subprocess 卡死可以拖垮 Hermes plugin 进程。timeout 必须显式。</li>\n<li><strong>trace_id 在跨 tier 边界丢失</strong>：每个边界点 (subprocess argv / webhook header) 都得显式透传。debug 痛苦多半源于此。</li>\n<li><strong>Stop hook 频繁返回 exit 2</strong>：如果 OpenClaw 一直拒绝 stop，agent 陷入&quot;被强制继续&quot;循环。OpenClaw 应在判定逻辑里加 max attempts，超过后允许 stop 并 raise alert。</li>\n<li><strong>subprocess 共用同一 working dir</strong>：多个 plugin 并发 spawn CC 容易抢占 tmp 文件。每次 spawn 用独立 tempdir。</li>\n<li><strong>webhook secret 全局共用</strong>：模式 B 用的 secret 应 per-OpenClaw-tenant 独立，不与 outbound webhook 通用 secret 复用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>跨 tier 协同有两条简单可靠的模式：Hermes Plugin 通过 spawn Claude Code subprocess 借用 Tier 1 的推理 / hook 能力，OpenClaw 通过 webhook 作 Stop hook 后端实现合规与 SOP enforcement。trace_id 透传是两条模式的共同约束，timeout 与 depth=0 是防止跨 tier 循环的硬保险。本章四篇覆盖完 Hermes transform pipeline + OpenClaw outbound webhook + 两套机制的跨 tier 编排——下一章进入 multi-tenant 路由与 persona 隔离，看 OpenClaw 如何用 5 级 lookup + DM pairing 把&quot;一个物理用户多个 persona&quot;做成系统化产品。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"与 Tier 1 Hooks 协同的跨 tier 桥接模式","id":"与-tier-1-hooks-协同的跨-tier-桥接模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模式 A：Hermes Plugin spawn Claude Code","id":"模式-a-hermes-plugin-spawn-claude-code"},{"level":2,"text":"hook stdout 作 transform 输入","id":"hook-stdout-作-transform-输入"},{"level":2,"text":"模式 B：OpenClaw webhook 作 Stop hook 后端","id":"模式-b-openclaw-webhook-作-stop-hook-后端"},{"level":2,"text":"跨 tier 协议层","id":"跨-tier-协议层"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该选哪条模式","id":"何时该选哪条模式"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenClaw outbound webhooks 与 HMAC 签名模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/openclaw-outbound-webhooks"},"next":{"title":"OpenClaw 路由 5 级 lookup 详解","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/five-level-routing-lookup"}}